     jjoobbss [--ll | --pp] [_i_d _._._.]
         Display the status of all jobs in the current shell environment, or
         those selected by _i_d.

         The options to the jjoobbss command are as follows:

            --ll      Additionally display the process group ID.
            --pp      Display only the process group ID.

         Job _i_d can be selected in one of the following ways:

            %%        The current job.
            %+        The current job.
            %-        The previous job.
